A||||7||86SE||I made it!  Car gettin painted this weekend - Keep you posted.||||14||
Z||000000||86SE||07-11-2000||12:32 AM||||I drove from Emery SD to Omaha NE yesterday.  About 260 miles, burned about 7.5 gallons of fuel!  I was surprised!<P>Anyway, took it to the shop today and did a TON of body work to it in the 6 hours (in blazing heat) I was down there.  I tore the qtr panels off, qtr windows, spoiler, hood, front and rear bumpers, inside door panels, mirrors, door handles, sunroof, engine vent grills, tail lights, all moldings, all side marker lights, and I think thats about it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I took the air sander with some 220 sandpaper and sanded out most of the deeps chips and scratches, and there was a lot of em!!  So far I wet sanded the spoiler, decklid, and drivers  side door panel.  I'll get the qtr panels preped and wetsanded tomorrow, and take off the decklid, and try to take off the outside doorpanels.<P>Oh yeah, and I finally welded that damn crack in the exhaust manifold!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  much better.<P>It sould be ready to paint (color change) Ferrari yellow by Sunday, im sure the panels I have already taken off will be painted sooner.<P>I'll start bright and early on it tomorrow morning.  Have to do a TON of wetsanding.  I'll take some pictures of it when its all torn apart, and when its in the paintbooth and when its ALL DONE! I can't wait!<P>Total cost of it all is about $110 and a lot of elbow oil.<P>PS:  I'll be chillin out in Omaha for a couple weeks.....<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Fiero||||reg||14
Z||000001||Dan86gt3.8||07-11-2000||12:41 AM||||Sweet!  I am about to do the same thing with probably the ferari yellow.  AAlthough I am getting lazy on the sanding I need to get on it!  Anyways I am intersted to see how it turns out!<P>------------------<BR>86 gt fiero<BR>3.8/4speed auto<BR>ace conversion kit<BR>15" konig monsoon's<BR>rear swaybar/ and urethane on rear.<BR>Soon to come urethane all the way around. and new yellow paint w/ raised spoiler!!!!<BR>(also in way future years forced induction on my 3.8!!!!!!!!!)||||reg||1
