Z||000007||86SE||07-13-2000||11:14 PM||||Progress Report ---<P>Took off the headlight doors, gas filler cap, decklid and outer door skins!  Its ugly!!<P>Shot the hood, fenders, and bumpers with 2 coats yellow, and 2 coats clear!  They look AWESOME!!  WOW!<P>The rest of the parts will be painted Friday, and the parts on the car will be painted this weekend...<P>------------------<BR>'86 Special Edition,<BR>High-Output V-6 Fiero||||reg||14
